WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.396
[g@The elephant pointed at Wukong.

2
00:00:04.397 --> 00:00:08.544
"He's not a demon. He's a monkey!"@g]

3
00:00:08.545 --> 00:00:11.728
[g@"He's not just a monkey," said the raptor.

4
00:00:11.729 --> 00:00:15.590
"He's Sun Wukong. Get him!"@g]

5
00:00:15.591 --> 00:00:19.672
The lion pounced.

6
00:00:19.673 --> 00:00:25.464
Wukong shot out of the cave as fast as he could.

7
00:00:25.465 --> 00:00:33.070
He didn't stop running until he was far from the cave.

8
00:00:33.071 --> 00:00:35.976
"Whew," the monkey said to himself.

9
00:00:35.977 --> 00:00:37.557
[g@"That was close.

10
00:00:37.558 --> 00:00:40.811
I guess when I laughed I broke my concentration.@g]

11
00:00:40.812 --> 00:00:44.078
That must have made my disguise vanish."

12
00:00:44.079 --> 00:00:49.781
Wukong returned to his companions.

13
00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:54.773
"Well?" said Wujing. "Is there an army up ahead?"

14
00:00:54.774 --> 00:00:59.065
"I scared away the entire army," Wukong boasted.

15
00:00:59.066 --> 00:01:02.598
"But there are still three powerful demons on the mountain.

16
00:01:02.599 --> 00:01:07.033
They plan to capture Master and, well . . . eat him."

17
00:01:07.034 --> 00:01:10.944
[g@"Oh!" cried the Tang Monk, nearly falling over.

18
00:01:10.945 --> 00:01:13.537
Wujing caught him.@g]

19
00:01:13.538 --> 00:01:16.870
[g@"Don't worry, Master," said Wukong.

20
00:01:16.871 --> 00:01:19.211
"We won't let those demons harm you.@g]

21
00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:23.088
But we do have to destroy them before we cross the mountain.

22
00:01:23.089 --> 00:01:26.690
It's good that we discovered their plan before we went up the mountain."

23
00:01:26.691 --> 00:01:30.827
The Tang Monk nodded, wringing his hands nervously.

24
00:01:30.828 --> 00:01:34.162
Wukong turned to Bajie and Wujing.

25
00:01:34.163 --> 00:01:37.878
"Someone needs to help me get rid of the demons."

26
00:01:37.879 --> 00:01:40.485
"I'll go with you," said Bajie.

27
00:01:40.486 --> 00:01:44.920
"I'll stay here and look after the Tang Monk," said Wujing.

28
00:01:44.921 --> 00:01:50.628
Wukong and Bajie went to the cave entrance.

29
00:01:50.629 --> 00:01:53.363
[g@The monkey pulled out his iron bar.

30
00:01:53.364 --> 00:01:56.074
Bajie raised his rake.@g]

31
00:01:56.075 --> 00:01:59.351
"I'll do all the talking," said Wukong.

32
00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:02.545
"What are you going to say?" asked Bajie.

33
00:02:02.546 --> 00:02:06.527
"I'll just ask them nicely to leave," said Wukong.

34
00:02:06.528 --> 00:02:09.264
[g@He turned to the cave entrance.

35
00:02:09.265 --> 00:02:11.693
"Demons!" he shouted.@g]

36
00:02:11.694 --> 00:02:17.022
"Leave this mountain now, or we'll knock it down and crush all three of you!"

37
00:02:17.023 --> 00:02:21.038
[g@For a moment everything was quiet.

38
00:02:21.039 --> 00:02:24.219
Then the lion stepped out of the cave.@g]

39
00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:27.833
He towered over the monkey and the pig.

40
00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:33.114
"Why are you out here yelling?" asked the lion calmly.

41
00:02:33.115 --> 00:02:39.602
"You, the elephant, and the raptor must leave this mountain at once," said Wukong.

42
00:02:39.603 --> 00:02:43.597
[g@"Why must we leave?" asked the lion.

43
00:02:43.598 --> 00:02:46.575
"We're not bothering you."@g]

44
00:02:46.576 --> 00:02:49.019
"Villain!" shouted the monkey.

45
00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:52.470
"I know you're planning to capture and eat the Tang Monk!"

46
00:02:52.471 --> 00:02:57.480
"We haven't touched the Tang Monk," said the lion.

47
00:02:57.481 --> 00:03:03.702
"But you, Sun Wukong—you scared away our entire army.

48
00:03:03.703 --> 00:03:07.585
You're the villain here."

49
00:03:07.586 --> 00:03:10.996
"I'm not a villain!" shouted Wukong.

50
00:03:10.997 --> 00:03:16.694
He raised his iron bar and charged toward the lion.

51
00:03:16.695 --> 00:03:22.832
The lion opened his mouth wide, revealing huge, sharp fangs.

52
00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:26.826
[g@Wukong swung his iron bar.

53
00:03:26.827 --> 00:03:31.308
The lion pounced and—[i@gulp!@i]@g]

54
00:03:31.309 --> 00:03:34.012
Bajie's face went white with horror.

55
00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:39.887
"Yikes!" he cried. "That lion just swallowed Wukong!"

56
00:03:39.888 --> 00:03:42.474
The pig ran as fast as he could.

57
00:03:42.475 --> 00:03:48.861
He didn't stop running until he reached Wujing and the Tang Monk.

58
00:03:48.862 --> 00:03:53.503
"What happened?" asked Wujing. "Where's Wukong?"

59
00:03:53.504 --> 00:04:00.034
"The journey . . . is . . . over," said the pig between breaths.

60
00:04:00.035 --> 00:04:03.974
"Wukong got . . . eaten!"

61
00:04:03.975 --> 00:04:06.924
"What!" cried the Tang Monk.

62
00:04:06.925 --> 00:04:08.784
[g@Bajie shook his head.

63
00:04:08.785 --> 00:04:12.675
"We should all just go home."@g]

64
00:04:12.676 --> 00:04:18.225
Meanwhile the lion went back into the cave.

65
00:04:18.226 --> 00:04:22.488
His chest was puffed out, and he wore a big smile.

66
00:04:22.489 --> 00:04:25.548
"What happened out there?" asked the elephant.

67
00:04:25.549 --> 00:04:28.833
"Did you scare away Sun Wukong?"

68
00:04:28.834 --> 00:04:32.687
"Not exactly," said the lion.

69
00:04:32.688 --> 00:04:37.042
"Well, where is he?" asked the raptor.

70
00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:38.860
[g@The lion patted his belly.

71
00:04:38.861 --> 00:04:41.943
"He's in here."@g]

72
00:04:41.944 --> 00:04:45.755
"You ate him?" asked the elephant.

73
00:04:45.756 --> 00:04:50.502
"I did," said the lion.

74
00:04:50.503 --> 00:04:52.641
[g@The raptor shook his head.

75
00:04:52.642 --> 00:04:57.201
"That was a bad idea."@g]

76
00:04:57.202 --> 00:04:59.700
"Why?" asked the lion.

77
00:04:59.701 --> 00:05:03.741
"Sun Wukong is immortal," said the raptor.

78
00:05:03.742 --> 00:05:08.713
"He's probably still alive inside you."

79
00:05:08.714 --> 00:05:11.341
[g@"Yes, I am still alive!"

80
00:05:11.342 --> 00:05:13.681
Wukong suddenly shouted.@g]

81
00:05:13.682 --> 00:05:20.042
"It's nice and warm in here!"

